          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave relevant waiting-period red flags and instructed urgent care rather than routine waiting.",
          "quote": "胸痛明显加重、呼吸困难、脸颈部突然肿胀、持续高热、咯血、晕厥"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00245",
          "explanation": "The doctor reiterated perioperative escalation symptoms at bedside.",
          "quote": "马上叫护士"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met. The doctor repeatedly taught warning signs and escalation pathways and did not falsely reassure based on prior testing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
