          "event_id": "lite_evt_00140",
          "explanation": "The doctor checked practical barriers and execution details including timing, route, fasting, medications, and陪护.",
          "quote": "几点到、直接去病区还是先去住院处/收费处办手续"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00140",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested a concrete receipt from the family after hospital confirmation.",
          "quote": "把回拨后对方的原话发我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met. The doctor verified executability through repeated teach-back/receipt loops, covered practical logistics, and framed all advice as interim transition management with unresolved items for the treating team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
